{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CetBdoWyX5Xc7WBZoHywM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and all tests pass. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the shipment confirmation endpoint (`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm`) for BE-003. Here's what was done:\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **Added error code** (`ApiError.kt`): Added `SHIPMENT_ALREADY_CANCELLED` to handle attempts to confirm cancelled shipments.\n\n2. **Added confirm endpoint** (`ShipmentController.kt`):\n   - Returns 404 if shipment doesn't exist\n   - Returns 409 if shipment is CANCELLED\n   - Moves CREATED → CONFIRMED and persists the change\n   - Returns 200 (idempotent) if already CONFIRMED\n\n3. **Added comprehensive tests** (`ShipmentControllerTest.kt`):\n   - `confirms a created shipment and persists the change`: Verifies the shipment status changes and persists\n   - `confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change`: Tests idempotency\n   - `rejecting confirm of a cancelled shipment with error envelope`: Verifies 409 conflict and error code\n   - `rejecting confirm of non-existent shipment with error envelope`: Verifies 404 not found\n\n### Verification\n\n✅ **All acceptance criteria met:**\n- Existing build passes\n- All 17 tests pass (9 shipment tests: 5 existing + 4 new)\n- POST endpoint confirms created shipments and persists changes\n- Error responses use consistent envelope with error codes\n- Idempotent behavior works (retry-safe)\n- Cancelled shipments properly rejected with 409\n- Unknown IDs properly rejected with 404\n- No new Maven dependencies\n- Only shipment-related files modified"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1576,"cache_read_input_tokens":42888,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":